{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-hw8m-q44c-ggrf","cve_id":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security-advisories/GHSA-hw8m-q44c-ggrf","html_url":"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hw8m-q44c-ggrf","summary":"Rooting for GC values live across `try_call` may be missing, causing GC heap corruption","description":"## Impact\r\n\r\nWhen compiling a Wasm module that uses GC references, a GC reference that is live across a `try_call` may, in certain conditions, not be properly rooted. If the callee causes a garbage collection, that reference may become stale or dangling, causing further issues including GC heap corruption or other incorrect execution.\r\n\r\nEvery Wasmtime version with GC and exceptions is affected by this issue. Both GC and exceptions are on-by-default in Wasmtime v47 and above.\r\n\r\n## Patches\r\n\r\nThe fix is present in main and patch releases are made for 48.0.4 and 49.0.2.\r\n\r\n## Workarounds\r\n\r\nDisable exception support in the CLI via `-W exceptions=n` or the API via `Config::wasm_exceptions(false)`.","severity":"medium","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"alexcrichton","id":64996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton","html_url":"https://github.com/alexcrichton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-hw8m-q44c-ggrf","type":"GHSA"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-02T19:38:58Z","published_at":"2026-10-02T19:38:57Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"rust","name":"wasmtime"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 47.0.0, < 48.0.4, >= 49.0.0, < 49.0.2","patched_versions":"48.0.4, 49.0.2","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.7},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":null}},"cwes":[],"cwe_ids":[],"credits":[],"credits_detailed":[],"collaborating_users":null,"collaborating_teams":null,"private_fork":null,"comments":1,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.7}}